// Icon of the .exe on Windows.
//
// rc.exe resolves relative paths with /I, and CMake puts resources/ as an
// include dir of the target (see CMakeLists.txt, if(WIN32) block). That is why the
// path is "icon/nt.ico" and not "resources/icon/nt.ico".
//
// Without this .rc the .exe comes out with the system default icon: it is seen in the
// taskbar, in Explorer and in the apps list. The shortcuts
// that the setup creates (dist.iss / dist64.iss) use the SAME nt.ico, so
// the shortcut icon and the binary's icon are identical.
IDI_ICON1 ICON    DISCARDABLE "icon/nt.ico"
